# 统一入库时的换行与差异呈现。

# 默认：文本文件自动识别，入库一律 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确的二进制类型，不做换行转换，也不做行级 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.wasm binary

# 机器生成的文件：linguist-generated 让 GitHub 的 PR 页面默认折叠它们。
# 不加 `-diff`，保证 `git diff Cargo.lock` 仍逐行可读。
Cargo.lock   linguist-generated=true
CHANGELOG.md linguist-generated=true

# 让 `git diff` 的 hunk 头显示所在的 fn / impl
*.rs diff=rust
